// # While body must be Void
//
// Logline: Check refuses a while body that types as Int.
//
// Setup: Single-file probe. Body is a lone 1. Line of while stays under 50.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Loop while true.
//   2. Place an Int expression in the body.
//   3. check must ERR type while loop body must return Void.

pub fn main() {
    while true {
        1
    }
}
